flowchart TB
  USER[Usuário / Internet]
  SG[EC2 Security Group<br/>HTTP 80 / HTTPS 443<br/>SSH 22 restrito ao CIDR configurado]
  EC2[Amazon EC2 t3.small<br/>Amazon Linux 2 AMI]
  DOCKER[Docker + Docker Compose<br/>instalados via user_data]
  TRAEFIK[Traefik<br/>proxy reverso / TLS]
  WP[WordPress container<br/>porta interna 80]
  DB[MySQL 8.0 container]
  PMA[phpMyAdmin container]
  VOL[(Docker volumes<br/>wordpress / db)]
  USER --> SG --> EC2 --> DOCKER --> TRAEFIK
  TRAEFIK --> WP
  TRAEFIK --> PMA
  WP --> DB
  WP --> VOL
  DB --> VOL
  NOTE[Compose referencia rede externa traefik.<br/>O script deve garantir que ela exista antes do compose up.]
  TRAEFIK -.-> NOTE
